Package: abraflexi-tui
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, abraflexi-cli
Description: Turbo Vision TUI frontend for AbraFlexi CLI
 abraflexi-tui provides a terminal user interface for the abraflexi-cli
 tool, built with the Turbo Vision (tvision) library.
 .
 It shells out to abraflexi-cli for all AbraFlexi connectivity and
 renders company, evidence and record data in a classic text-mode UI:
  * Connection status, company list and evidence browser screens
  * Generic, evidence-parameterized record list and detail view
  * Record creation with mandatory-field hints and dry-run support
  * Saved server profiles (password or session token) and the request URL
    in the status line
 .
 This package provides a keyboard-driven way to browse and create
 AbraFlexi records without leaving the terminal.
